const T2 = "<section class=\"svc-intro mm-intro\"><div class=\"mm-marco\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Outdoor Kitchen Builders &amp; Contractors in <span class=\"mm-rot\">Florida</span></h2><p class=\"mm-p\">Our outdoor kitchen contractors design and build custom outdoor kitchens in North &amp; South Florida, integrating durable materials, modern appliances, and functional layouts for effortless entertaining.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/about\">More About Us<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"mm-gal\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Outdoor Kitchen Gallery</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Florida outdoor kitchen builds — premium grills, stone counters, and bespoke dining rooms.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/gallery\">Project Gallery<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-fotos\"><div class=\"mm-mosaico mm-mosaico--6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-8/premium-outdoor-kitchen-installation-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Premium custom outdoor kitchen installation completed in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-8/premium-outdoor-kitchen-installation-florida.avif\" alt=\"Premium custom outdoor kitchen installation completed in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-7/modern-custom-outdoor-kitchen-design-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom outdoor kitchen installed near a pool for Florida outdoor living\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-7/modern-custom-outdoor-kitchen-design-florida.avif\" alt=\"Custom outdoor kitchen installed near a pool for Florida outdoor living\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-6/luxury-custom-outdoor-kitchen-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: High-end custom outdoor kitchen layout designed for luxury Florida homes\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-6/luxury-custom-outdoor-kitchen-florida.avif\" alt=\"High-end custom outdoor kitchen layout designed for luxury Florida homes\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-5/high-end-outdoor-kitchen-layout-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Modern custom outdoor kitchen design for Florida residential properties\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-5/high-end-outdoor-kitchen-layout-florida.avif\" alt=\"Modern custom outdoor kitchen design for Florida residential properties\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-4/custom-outdoor-kitchen-with-grill-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom outdoor kitchen with built-in grill for Florida outdoor entertaining\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-4/custom-outdoor-kitchen-with-grill-florida.avif\" alt=\"Custom outdoor kitchen with built-in grill for Florida outdoor entertaining\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-u-shape-pizza-oven-pool-view-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: U-shaped outdoor kitchen with pizza oven, open grill and side burner beside a pool.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-u-shape-pizza-oven-pool-view-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"U-shaped outdoor kitchen with pizza oven, open grill and side burner beside a pool.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico-resto\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/kitchen-1/covered-custom-outdoor-kitchen-florida.avif\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom outdoor kitchen built by professional outdoor kitchen builders in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/kitchen-1/covered-custom-outdoor-kitchen-florida.avif\" alt=\"Custom outdoor kitchen built by professional outdoor kitchen builders in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda mm-celda--resto\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-white-grill-farmhouse-sink-lanai-florida-03.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: White outdoor kitchen with built-in grill, farmhouse sink and under-counter fridge on gray pavers.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/kitchens/outdoor-kitchen-white-grill-farmhouse-sink-lanai-florida-03.webp\" alt=\"White outdoor kitchen with built-in grill, farmhouse sink and under-counter fridge on gray pavers.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1600\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 25vw, 50vw\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc mm-proc--sin\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Outdoor Kitchen Build <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our outdoor kitchen contractors handle design, permits, utility work, and full installation for stress-free projects across North &amp; South Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><ol class=\"mm-pasos\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Functionality &amp; Equipment Assessment</h3><p>Consultation on cooking equipment selection (grills, ovens, cooktops), food prep surfaces, storage needs, and utility integration (gas, electrical, plumbing). We review multi-brand dealer options.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Kitchen Design &amp; Integration</h3><p>Comprehensive design showing equipment placement, counter layouts, seating areas, and workflow optimization. 3D renderings display the complete outdoor kitchen experience.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Utility Routing &amp; Building Permits</h3><p>Engineering for gas line routing, electrical distribution, plumbing integration, and structural foundation work. Permit acquisition for utility modifications and outdoor structure installation.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Equipment Installation &amp; System Testing</h3><p>Professional installation of all equipment, utility connections, and integration with surrounding elements. Full system testing and operational training for all appliances.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Outdoor Kitchen Design &amp; Construction Services</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We design and construct custom outdoor kitchens in North &amp; South Florida, integrating durable finishes and modern cooking appliances.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Layout, Design &amp; Modules</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We build outdoor kitchens two ways. Modular cabinetry drops into a straight run along a lanai or pool deck; full masonry handles L-shapes, curves, and tight setbacks against a screen enclosure. Either layout keeps the grill venting away from the house and the prep space within reach of it.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Outdoor Kitchen Design</dt><dd>South Florida builders design bespoke outdoor kitchens tailored to homeowners’ cooking and entertaining needs</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Modular Kitchen Installation</dt><dd>Contractors install prefabricated outdoor kitchen modules for quick, cost‑effective setups.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Grill Islands &amp; Pizza Ovens</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Built-in grills need code clearance to combustibles, a rated hood where the island sits under a solid roof, and gas and electrical runs sized for the appliance. Wood-fired and gas ovens weigh hundreds of pounds, so they land on a slab that carries the load or on footings we pour.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Grilling Island Construction</dt><dd>Installers build custom grilling stations with countertops, storage, and utilities for Florida homeowners</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Outdoor Pizza Oven Builders</dt><dd>Builders install wood‑fired or gas pizza ovens, adding artisan cooking options to outdoor kitchens</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Bars, Beverages &amp; Remodels</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Bars and beverage centers add plumbing and power to the island: a sink, a drain line, GFCI circuits in weatherproof covers, refrigeration rated for outdoor use. Remodels run the same trades through an existing shell, and salt air has usually gone after its fasteners and framing.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Outdoor Bar &amp; Beverage Centers</dt><dd>Contractors construct bars with sinks, refrigeration, and lighting for residential outdoor entertaining</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Outdoor Kitchen Remodeling</dt><dd>Renovation experts upgrade existing outdoor kitchens with new finishes, appliances, and layouts</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Materials, Permits &amp; Trades</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Coastal exposure ruins ordinary cabinetry, so we build with marine-grade polymer, 316 stainless, and quartzite or porcelain tops that hold color under Florida UV. We pull the gas, electrical, and plumbing permits under our own license, and the licensed trades on site answer to us.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Durable Material Installation</dt><dd>Installers use marine‑grade polymer, stainless steel, and quartzite for long‑lasting outdoor kitchens</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Permit &amp; Contractor Coordination</dt><dd>Professionals handle permits and coordinate subcontractors for seamless outdoor kitchen projects</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos mm-datos--tel\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 42vw, 100vw\" src=\"/images/obra/suelta/outdoor-kitchen-built-in-grill-pizza-oven-white-slat-wall-florida.avif\" alt=\"Outdoor kitchen with a built-in grill and a countertop pizza oven in front of a white slatted privacy wall\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1066\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Gri